      "id": "OpeningForest",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Lethiel leads you into the Thornwood, a deep, old forest of giant trees. Here even the hedges have thorns as long as spears.",
        "id-id": "Lethiel menuntunmu masuk ke Thornwood, hutan tua yang dalam dengan pohon-pohon raksasa. Di sini, bahkan pagar semaknya punya duri sepanjang tombak."
