    {
      "id": "EndingCamp",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Under the roots, you find the cutters' empty camp. They left their pay behind: coins of bone, cold as ice, in a purse with the seal of three lanes, cut through.",
        "id-id": "Di bawah akar, kamu menemukan perkemahan para penyayat yang kosong. Mereka meninggalkan upah mereka: koin-koin tulang, sedingin es, di dalam kantong bersegel tiga jalur yang terpotong."
      },
