    {
      "id": "EndingColossus",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Before its eyes close, the Old Bramble sends the Mountain Colossus with you. / Old Bramble: Find the ones with the knives, small one. My Colossus will walk with you.",
        "id-id": "Sebelum matanya terpejam, Old Bramble mengirim Raksasa Gunung bersamamu. / Old Bramble: Temukan mereka yang membawa pisau, makhluk kecil. Colossus-ku akan berjalan bersamamu."
